<title>NETHERLANDS: NBM-Amstelland H1 net more than doubles.</title>
<headline>NBM-Amstelland H1 net more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.09 vs   0.95</p>
<p>    Net profit			    33.6  vs  16.3</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.51 vs   1.09</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction group NBM Amstelland was expected by analysts to produce a first-half net profit between 19.1 million and 22 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		    55.6  vs  26.9</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    12.7  vs   6.6</p>
<p>    Income from associates	     6.4  vs   3.4</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.7  vs   7.2</p>
<p>    Writedowns			    36.3  vs  17.8</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     69.9  vs  34.1</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
